Package: cudalearnr
Title: GPU-Aware Numerical Learning Algorithms for R
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides experimental GPU-aware numerical algorithms for R,
    including singular value decomposition, principal component analysis,
    pairwise distances, nearest neighbours, and k-means clustering. Uses an
    optional CUDA-enabled 'torch' backend and portable base R fallbacks with
    explicit reporting of the backend used.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://cudaverse.github.io/cudalearnr/,
    https://github.com/cudaverse/cudalearnr
BugReports: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudalearnr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    cudatensr (>= 0.1.2),
    stats
Remotes:
    cudaverse/cudatensr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    torch
